// CHANGELOG 1.6.0:
// - Added native dropdown integration for bonus sorting (Sort by: Bonus ascending/descending)
// - Fixed CSS grid sorting to target LI elements instead of DIV tiles
// - Improved dropdown closing mechanism with blur + body click + escape key
// - Added cosmetic "Sort by:" prefix to bonus options
// - Bonus sorting automatically re-applies when new items load via pagination
//
// CHANGELOG 1.4.8:
// - extractInventoryBonuses() now returns { weaponBonuses, modBonuses } instead of a
//   single filtered list — mods (100mW Laser, Tactical Brake, etc.) are no longer
//   discarded outright, just kept separate from the weapon's own bonuses. The "ⓘ"
//   icon's tooltip previously duplicated the same weapon bonus text already visible
//   inline; it now shows mod bonuses only, and only appears at all when the item
//   actually has a mod equipped. Weapon bonuses remain inline exactly as in 1.4.6/1.4.7.
// - Dropped the click-to-alert() popup on the inventory "ⓘ" icon (added in 1.4.4/kept
//   through 1.4.6) per explicit request — it's now a plain hover-tooltip affordance
//   only (title attribute), matching the bonus text itself. No click listener means
//   nothing here can ever intercept the row's own click/tap again. Trade-off: touch/
//   PDA users have no way to see truncated text, same as hovering the bonus text
//   directly would already be — accepted as the preferred behavior over the alert().

